graph TD
    A[Matrix Protein Synthesis] --> B{Matrix Component?}
    B -->|Collagen| C[Collagen Synthesis]
    B -->|Fibronectin| D[Fibronectin Assembly]
    B -->|Proteoglycans| E[Proteoglycan Formation]
    B -->|Elastin| F[Elastin Production]
    
    C --> G[Collagen Fibril Formation]
    G --> H[Collagen Cross-linking]
    H --> I[Collagen Matrix]
    
    D --> J[Fibronectin Dimerization]
    J --> K[Fibronectin Matrix]
    
    E --> L[Proteoglycan Assembly]
    L --> M[Proteoglycan Matrix]
    
    F --> N[Elastin Assembly]
    N --> O[Elastin Matrix]
    
    I --> P[ECM Assembly]
    K --> P
    M --> P
    O --> P
    
    P --> Q[Extracellular Matrix Complete]
    
    %% Regulation
    Q --> R[Matrix Status]
    R --> S{Matrix Integrity?}
    S -->|Normal| T[Assembly Inhibition]
    S -->|Compromised| U[Assembly Activation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    V[Collagen Synthase] --> C
    W[Fibronectin] --> D
    X[Proteoglycan Synthase] --> E
    Y[Elastin Synthase] --> F
    Z[Matrix Metalloproteinases] --> P
    AA[ECM Proteins] --> P
    
